{"data":{"id":"P4ilQHULA9A","slug":"jmsn","title":"Jmsn","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"xAtT3k2I7x8","slug":"everything-fades","title":"Everything Fades"},{"id":"7HA2aWwa4bY","slug":"walk-away","title":"Walk Away"},{"id":"GeyM_f6uzD8","slug":"ends","title":"Ends"},{"id":"ufCxfqY2iX8","slug":"ends-money","title":"Ends (Money)"},{"id":"7l1D-9VtiBc","slug":"hypnotized-live","title":"Hypnotized (Live)"},{"id":"IguXuhXY0b8","slug":"hypnotized","title":"Hypnotized"},{"id":"CR0jxmW9OR0","slug":"levy","title":"Levy"},{"id":"7s50-ORVSWU","slug":"cruel-intentions-remix-feat-snoh-aalegra","title":"Cruel Intentions (Remix) [feat. Snoh Aalegra]"},{"id":"7mv1i5VP6TQ","slug":"cruel-intentions-live","title":"Cruel Intentions (Live)"},{"id":"IZWrWBJmDWk","slug":"do-u-remember-the-time-evil-needle-remix","title":"Do U Remember the Time (Evil Needle Remix)"},{"id":"1n8GUSAX2QM","slug":"cruel-intentions","title":"Cruel Intentions"}]},"markers":[{"id":"e2GuTuDfeSw","position":36,"timestamp":"04:13:54","rawTrack":"JMSN - Levy","track":{"id":"CR0jxmW9OR0","path":"/artists/jmsn/tracks/levy/","slug":"levy","title":"Levy","artist":{"slug":"jmsn","title":"Jmsn"},"artwork":"images/artists/jmsn/tracks/levy.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"6BiI7D9Z9Gk","slug":"all-day-2019","tags":[6,19],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/station/soulection-all-day-2019/ra.1448183145"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection All Day 2019","artwork":"/images/episodes/souelction-all-day-2019.jpg","content":"**🎊🌟 Happy New Year 2019 🌟🎊**\n\nA day of exclusive mixes from [Jaël](/episodes/all-day-2019/#ja%C3%ABl-set), [Sharnie](/episodes/all-day-2019/#sharnies-set), and [Shaka Lion](/episodes/all-day-2019/#shaka-lions-set).\n<!--more-->\n\nPlaylist with sets are [available on SoundCloud](https://soundcloud.com/soulection/sets/soulection-all-day-2019), the full 8 hour clean version is [available on Beats1](https://itunes.apple.com/gb/station/soulection-all-day-2019/ra.1448183145)\n\n#### Jump to:\n\n- [Jaël's Set](/episodes/all-day-2019/#ja%C3%ABl-set)\n- [Sharnies's Set](/episodes/all-day-2019/#sharnies-set)\n- [Joe Kay's Second Set](/episodes/all-day-2019/#joe-kays-second-set)\n- [Shaka Lion's Set](/episodes/all-day-2019/#shaka-lions-set)\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":29100,"location":"US","published_at":"2019-01-01T16:21:36+00:00"},"title":"Sharnie's Set","position":2}},{"id":"PHVm1qBOwzA","position":10,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jmsn - Everything Fades","track":{"id":"xAtT3k2I7x8","path":"/artists/jmsn/tracks/everything-fades/","slug":"everything-fades","title":"Everything Fades","artist":{"slug":"jmsn","title":"Jmsn"},"artwork":"images/artists/jmsn/tracks/everything-fades.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"xj9ohERACh8","slug":"153","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-153-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #153 w/ Dream Koala","artwork":"/images/episodes/153.jpg","content":"\nJoe Kay kicked things off with heavy, heavy vibes from many brand new/unheard artists and collectives. \n<!--more-->\n\nThe selection in here was really well thought out and analyzed properly so take notes.\n\nShouts to Geode and the Chord Marauders who sent over their forthcoming compilation which is simply amazing. Pay attention to these guys, trust. Also look out for Sunni Colòn & Jarreau Vandal. These two artists will be breakthrough artists on Soulection in 2014; guaranteed. We had special guest Dream Koala stop by who is visiting LA for his 1st time all the way from Berlin (current residence but originally from Paris). The young 19 year old threw down a DJ set that included bass and uptempo tribal vibes. In fact, his set was very different from his original production. Dream Koala is very talented and we look forward to see and hear what's to come. \n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10840,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-23T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Interview w/ Dream Koala + Sean O","position":2}},{"id":"ySBA3RRgrMM","position":6,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"JMSN - Walk Away","track":{"id":"7HA2aWwa4bY","path":"/artists/jmsn/tracks/walk-away/","slug":"walk-away","title":"Walk Away","artist":{"slug":"jmsn","title":"Jmsn"},"artwork":"images/artists/jmsn/tracks/walk-away.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"71ZXZF57G88","slug":"163","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-163-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #163 w/ Little Simz","artwork":"/images/episodes/163.jpg","content":"Little Sims joins Joe Kay with an exclusive Soulection mix.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":11016,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-02-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Little Simz' Set + Interview","position":1}},{"id":"95zTuXXuSCQ","position":5,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"JMSN - Do U Remember the Time (Evil Needle Remix)","track":{"id":"IZWrWBJmDWk","path":"/artists/jmsn/tracks/do-u-remember-the-time-evil-needle-remix/","slug":"do-u-remember-the-time-evil-needle-remix","title":"Do U Remember the Time (Evil Needle Remix)","artist":{"slug":"jmsn","title":"Jmsn"},"artwork":"images/artists/jmsn/tracks/do-u-remember-the-time-evil-needle-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"W3k2t5eT5Eo","slug":"170","tags":[5,1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-170-w-eden-hagos-andre-power"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #170 w/ Eden Hagos & Andre Power","artwork":"/images/episodes/170.jpg","content":"Andre Power covers while Joe Kay is at Coachella.\n<!--more-->\n\nThese two did a great job of playing a variety of soulful classics along with new discoveries. This show is definitely on that deep thought vibe. Joe will be back this Saturday to continue on the progression. Spread the word, tell a friend.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10900,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-12T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Andre Power's Set","position":1}},{"id":"YSgAnwhI9WQ","position":8,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"JMSN - Ends","track":{"id":"GeyM_f6uzD8","path":"/artists/jmsn/tracks/ends/","slug":"ends","title":"Ends","artist":{"slug":"jmsn","title":"Jmsn"},"artwork":"images/artists/jmsn/tracks/ends.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"t26W25WELwY","slug":"190","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-190-w-esta"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #190 w/ Esta","artwork":"/images/episodes/190.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10834,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-10-26T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"vxNh-A-HhRM","position":52,"timestamp":"01:52:02","rawTrack":"JMSN - Ends (Money)","track":{"id":"ufCxfqY2iX8","path":"/artists/jmsn/tracks/ends-money/","slug":"ends-money","title":"Ends (Money)","artist":{"slug":"jmsn","title":"Jmsn"},"artwork":"images/artists/jmsn/tracks/ends-money.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"40WMVTvGIt8","slug":"219","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/station/episode-219/ra.1081587871","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-219"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #219","artwork":"/images/episodes/219.jpg","content":"Premiering a Jaden Smith and Mr. Carmack collaboration.\n\n\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7153,"location":"US","published_at":"2015-08-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"WlPhEpi6nfM","position":51,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack